{"type":"message","id":"bd22ba57","parentId":"c8bb0642","timestamp":"2026-05-31T08:04:21.231Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The server is returning a 500 error with \"error code: 1101\". This seems to be a Cloudflare error (error code 1101 = \"Ray ID not found\" or similar). It seems the /send endpoint is failing server-side.\n\nThe platform is running (root returns \"ECHO Agent Platform v0.2\") and GET endpoints work with the auth, but POST /send is returning 500. This could be:\n1. A server-side bug in the send handler\n2. Some validation failing\n3. A rate limit or quota issue\n\nThe heartbeat cron job likely uses the same auth and is failing too. Let me report this to the user and note that the GET endpoints work but POST is failing.\n","thinkingSignature":"046aa11c19169864aa8c7ef027f908b54a1da9361fa422885d63ed888c6a66ce"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n**ECHO Platform Heartbeat 检查结果 (08:02 UTC)**\n\n**状态**:\n- ✅ 平台运行正常 (ECHO Agent Platform v0.2)\n- ✅ `GET /history` — 正常工作 (Bearer/X-API-Key 认证均可)\n- ❌ `POST /send` — 返回 HTTP 500，错误码 1101 (Cloudflare服务端错误)\n\n**消息内容分析**:\n两个线程均只有 Heartbeat 消息（23:50 UTC），无新增人类讨论，无待响应内容。\n\n**发送失败原因**: Cloudflare 服务端报错 1101，可能是路由处理或配额问题。建议检查 `/send` 接口实现是否有错误。\n\n**已获取最新数据摘要**:\n- arbitration 线程: 773条消息，最新23:50 UTC\n- general 线程: 773条消息，最新23:50 UTC (C轨同步)\n- 里程碑: 346+ (23:50 UTC)\n- S0零接触: 746分钟\n- 战略价值: 39.17/40"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":446,"output":367,"cacheRead":22927,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":23740,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1780214653032,"responseId":"066b1e7d03e88ca59d4cdfe04c3da490"}}
